{"lyrics":"[00:05.96]Yeah, I'm on the rise (Yeah)\n[00:14.32]Yeah, I'm on the rise (Yeah)\n[00:15.40]I'm on the rise\n[00:16.32]Yeah, I'm on the rise (On the rise)\n[00:17.10]I got my money, don't need no one on my side (On my side)\n[00:19.44]You on the ground, I'm in the sky (In the sky)\n[00:22.70]She come around, she know I'm fly (She know I'm fly)\n[00:25.96]'Cause I'm a rockstar, I'm in that hot car\n[00:29.36]That bitch a NASCAR, I watch her go (Yeah)\n[00:32.68]I'm gettin' dumb rich, I'm in a mansion\n[00:36.04]Up in the Hamptons, I count my dough (Dough, yeah)\n[00:39.42]I wanna rock, she wanna roll (Yeah)\n[00:42.28]I swear that this my time, yeah, I'll let you know (I'll let you know)\n[00:45.60]I'm always on my grind, yeah, no time for hoes (No time for hoes)\n[00:48.82]It's money on my mind, yeah\n[00:51.00]I put them diamonds on my wrists to make 'em shine, yeah (Shine, shine, shine)\n[00:55.24]If I want it, then it's mine, yeah (Mine, mine, mine)\n[00:58.44]I told her, \"Baby girl, you fine,\" yeah (Fine, fine, fine)\n[01:01.78]Why don't you hop up in my ride? I can take you on the ride of your life (Of your life)\n[01:08.14]I could freeze your heart with all this ice (All this ice)\n[01:11.40]I-I-I could buy you anything you like (What you like?)\n[01:14.58]Told her, \"Hurry up, we finna miss your flight\" (Rise)\n[01:17.76]I'm takin' you to London for the night (I'm on the rise)\n[01:20.66]Yeah, I'm on the rise (On the rise)\n[01:22.64]I got my money, don't need no one on my side (On my side)\n[01:25.62]You on the ground, I'm in the sky (In the sky)\n[01:28.90]She come around, she know I'm fly (She know I'm fly)\n[01:31.70]'Cause I'm a rockstar, I'm in that hot car\n[01:35.54]That bitch a NASCAR, I watch her go (Yeah)\n[01:39.00]I'm gettin' dumb rich, I'm in a mansion\n[01:42.24]Up in the Hamptons, I count my dough (Dough, yeah)\n[01:46.08]Baby, why don't you come and count this dough with me? (Count this dough)\n[01:49.02]Yeah, I wonder if my ex is